// French (fr) designations for this guide's CodeSystems, as CodeSystem supplements
// (one file per locale). Agent translation, UNOFFICIAL: no human has reviewed or
// signed it off. Codes are unchanged. The two consent texts that are still drafting
// placeholders (<INSERT TEXT ...>) are left as written.

